Type: Package
Title: Combo Module (conttables2xK, conttablespaired2xK, corrInspect, regInspect, jmvplus)
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-09-02
Authors@R: c(person("Ravi", "Selker", role=c("aut", "cph")),
