Maintainer: Victor Moreno <v.moreno@iconcologia.net>
Description: A single sideloadable jamovi module bundling the analyses from
    conttables2xK, conttablespaired2xK, corrInspect, regInspect and jmvplus,
    for one-file installation. Each analysis is developed and released in its
    own repository (see README); this package only assembles them into one
    module -- see tools/assemble.R. Do not edit R/ or jamovi/ directly, they
    are generated.
